msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100.<br>Can only be executed immediately after blocking an attack.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Pacification</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increased enmity"
