msgid "Deals additional damage with a potency of 75 after each auto-attack. Damage affected by weapon delay.<br>Cannot be used with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Shield Oath</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Effect ends upon reuse."
