msgid "Take all damage intended for another party member as long as said member remains within 20 yalms.<br>Does not activate with certain attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Oath Gauge Cost: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>50"
