msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of <if ($gn68 == 20)><if ($gn72 >= 84)>{220}<else>{180}</if><else>{180}</if>.<br><if ($gn72 >= 50)><if ($gn68 == 2)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Opo-opo's Fury Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><if ($gn68 == 20)><if ($gn72 >= 84)>{420}<else>{380}</if><else>{380}</if><br><else><if ($gn68 == 20)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Opo-opo's Fury Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><if ($gn68 == 20)><if ($gn72 >= 84)>{420}<else>{380}</if><else>{380}</if><br></if></if></if><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Opo-opo Form Bonus: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Guarantees a critical hit<br>Damage dealt is increased when under an effect that raises critical hit rate.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Changes form to <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>raptor</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s"
