msgid "Reduces damage taken by 10%.<br>Cannot be used with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Fists of Fire</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Fists of Wind</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, and shares a recast timer with both.<br>Effect ends upon reuse."
