msgid "Grants 3 stacks of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Perfect Balance</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, each stack allowing the execution of a weaponskill that requires a certain form, without being in that form.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>20s<br><if ($gn68 == 20)><if ($gn72 >= 60)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Opo-opo Chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Coeurl Chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, or <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Raptor Chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color> depending on the form changed to upon executing actions<br>Changing to <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Opo-opo Form</ui-edge-color></ui-color> grants <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Coeurl Chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Changing to <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Raptor Form</ui-edge-color></ui-color> grants <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Opo-opo Chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Changing to <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Coeurl Form</ui-edge-color></ui-color> grants <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Raptor Chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br></if></if><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Maximum Charges: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>2<br><if ($gn68 == 20)><if ($gn72 >= 60)>Can only be executed while in combat and when not under the effect of any <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Beast Chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<else>Can only be executed while in combat.</if><else>Can only be executed while in combat.</if>"
