msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all nearby enemies.<br>Can only be executed when in <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>coeurl</ui-edge-color></ui-color> form.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Changes form to <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>opo-opo</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s"
