msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 120.<br>Can only be executed when in <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>raptor</ui-edge-color></ui-color> form.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stun</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 1s<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stun</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is impervious to stun nullifying effects.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Changes form to <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>coeurl</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
