msgid "Deals ice damage with a potency of 180.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Umbral Ice</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or removes <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Astral Fire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
