msgid "Afflicts target with <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Slow</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Heavy</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +20%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s (PvP 6s)"
