msgid "Restores 20% of maximum MP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Aetherflow III</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Can only be executed while in combat."
