msgid "Envelops a designated area in a veil of magicked shadows, dealing damage with a potency of 50 to any enemies who enter.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Slow</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +5%<br>Cannot be used with any other area-creating actions."
