#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:290:0:0"
msgid "Surveys the landscape to locate the highest-level mature tree or lush vegetation within skill range. Can only be executed while <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Triangulate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s"
msgstr "Показывает на карте ближайшее зрелое дерево или заросли наивысшего доступного уровня. Можно применить только при действии эффекта <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>«Триангуляция»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 сек."

#. ja: 自分が採集できる最もレベルの高い石や岩の位置を知り、ナビマップに反映する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>発動条件：</ui-edge-color></ui-color><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「プロスペクト」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>効果中<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Du entdeckst die für deine Stufe höchstgradige, am nächsten gelegene Lagerstätte und lässt diese Sammelstelle auf der Karte anzeigen.<br>Bedingung: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Prospektion</ui-edge-color></ui-color> aktiv<br>Dauer: 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Localise le filon de minerai ou la carrière la plus proche parmi ceux de niveau le plus élevé pour vos compétences, et indique son emplacement sur la boussole.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Condition<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Prospecteur</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:291:0:0"
msgid "Surveys the landscape to locate the highest-level mineral deposit or rocky outcrop within skill range. Can only be executed while <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Prospect</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s"
msgstr "Показывает на карте ближайшую залежь руды или скальный выход наивысшего доступного уровня. Можно применить только при действии эффекта <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>«Поиск месторождений»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 сек."

#. ja: ウィンドシャード<if ($gn68 >= 16)><if ($gn69 >= 50)>・クリスタル・クラスター<else><if ($gn69 >= 41)>・クリスタル</if></if></if>の獲得数を2アップする。
#. de: Du erhöhst die Anzahl der gesammelten Windscherben<if ($gn68 >= 16)><if ($gn69 >= 50)>, Windkristalle und Windpolykristalle<else><if ($gn69 >= 41)> und Windkristalle</if></if></if> um 2.
#. fr: Augmente de 2 la récolte d'éclats<if ($gn68 >= 16)><if ($gn69 >= 50)>, cristaux et agrégats<else><if ($gn69 >= 41)> et cristaux</if></if></if> de vent.
