msgid "Reduces weaponskill cast time and recast time, spell cast time and recast time, and auto-attack delay of self and nearby party members by 3%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s<br>When <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Obey</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active, will only execute upon command."
